OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at commercial  
OL,4,Apoultry farm                           
OL,6,FA fifth case of bird flu at a          
OL,7,Fcommercial poultry farm has been       
OL,8,Fconfirmed in East Yorkshire and        
OL,9,FLincolnshire, the Department for       
OL,10,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs    
OL,11,F(Defra) said.                          
OL,13,FAn outbreak of avian influenza (H5N1)  
OL,14,Fwas found at the farm near Driffield in
OL,15,FEast Yorkshire on 20 November. Another 
OL,16,Fcase was confirmed at a farm near      
OL,17,FPocklington on 7 November.             
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
