OL,3,GNEWSABird flu confirmed at commercial  
OL,4,Apoultry farm                           
OL,6,FA 1.9 miles (3km) protection zone and a
OL,7,F6.2 miles (10km) surveillance zone have
OL,8,Fbeen declared around the site, and all 
OL,9,Fbirds will be humanely culled, Defra   
OL,10,Fsaid.                                  
OL,12,FIn Lincolnshire, there have been three 
OL,13,Fconfirmed cases this month, on farms   
OL,14,Fnear Coningsby, Market Rasen and Brigg.
